WEBVTT

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.470
Hey, Pucchi… Did you know?

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.140
The average number of daily visitors
at the Louvre, Paris in the spring

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.480
is about 40,000.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.900
Since its doors opened in 1793,

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.150
more than 40,000 people flock

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.990
to view the Mona Lisa
and the Venus de Milo every day.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.450
The visitors do not leave
without seeing these two pieces.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.530
Isn't that incredible?

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.040
Incredible?
Do you mean the number of guests?

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.120
That's not it.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.330
Some of the world's
greatest painters and sculptors

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:50.090
are able to express their souls
in a form that can be seen by eyes.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.760
It's as if they create Stands
that exist beyond time and place.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:55.760
Wouldn't you agree?

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.680
It's an interesting thought.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:03.560
Does that make Leonardo Da Vinci
and Alexandros of Antioch Stand Users?

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.690
Yes, but I'm also talking about you.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.690
Your Pale Snake

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.400
is able to extract and store souls
by giving it form.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.570
Will you betray me one day?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.660
Why do you not attack me?

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.870
You know that
I would not survive in sunlight

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.330
and that I lay to rest
in the dark room during the day.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.210
All you have to do is
finish me off while I sleep.

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:30.130
If you turn my Stand, The World,
into a disc and take it,

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.300
you yourself could become king.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.210
So do it.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.350
That has never even crossed my mind.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:45.270
I like people who help me grow.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:47.520
You are the king among kings.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:51.900
I want to follow you
and see what kind of end you will reach.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:56.240
I love you, in the same manner
as men love their god.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.710
Sorry, that wasn't meant to insult you.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.380
It's that I've never considered

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:21.140
that there was a man
who could calm my soul just by us talking.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.060
I feared losing you.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.770
You will become a noble priest.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:30.150
Please, accept this.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.690
It is a symbol of my apology.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:34.570
I extracted it out of my body just now.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:39.820
No matter where you are, I will always
be able to lend you my powers.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.580
EPISODE 22: TIME FOR HEAVEN!
NEW MOON! NEW PRIEST!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.620
Jo…

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.920
Jolyne!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.140
Pale Snake.

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:06.010
Read Jolyne's whereabouts from that disc.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:08.730
Respond to me.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.190
What happened?

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.350
Is that you there?

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.900
Respond to me.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.980
Can you not hear me?

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.490
Why is this transceiver here?

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.320
Who is on the other end?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.240
Who?

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.700
Who the hell is it?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.790
All right.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.920
I understand.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.460
The situation is that serious, huh?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.920
I just left the medical wing.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.800
Bastard!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.130
It's Weather Forecast!

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.050
This rain…

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.680
Where is the disc?

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.270
This bastard!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.020
They had Weather Forecast summon rain!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.820
You won't escape me!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.620
Damn this rain!

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.160
I can't see anything… where did they go?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.210
And it's foggy.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:21.760
Where is this sound of
hitting rocks coming from?

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.260
I think it's Morse Code?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.760
Make the fog thicker…

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.800
They're after me.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:32.350
Pale Snake's User is Father Pucchi!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.640
He knows.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.770
He knows who I am!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:38.310
Weather Forecast knows!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.280
Five hundred three.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.160
Count the prime numbers.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:48.450
Five hundred nine.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.080
Five hundred twenty-one.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.500
Nothing can divide prime numbers.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.790
The reason why people lose…

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:57.920
Five hundred twenty-three.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.540
Shame leads men to defeat.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.500
Men die to compensate for their shame.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.970
Five hundred forty-one.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:08.510
Thoughts of shameful regret
such as "why did I do that earlier"

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.010
weakens men
and leads them to their defeat.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.180
I didn't make an error by failing
to see the guards' transceiver.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.640
No, this is a trial.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:19.480
There are still ways to prevail.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.690
Jolyne Cujoh doesn't know who I am yet.

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.740
Nothing has changed yet.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.200
I haven't completely lost them, either.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.370
True victors…

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.580
are those who can reign over
the circumstances given to them.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.710
It looks like you survived.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.920
Weather Forecast.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.090
Where are Jolyne and the others?

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.470
Anastasia.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.850
I'm really grateful
for everything you've done for me.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:56.060
Thanks to you, I've been safe until now.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:59.560
But why do you care so much about me?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:04.110
Finding out who Pale Snake is
and getting my father's memory back

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:05.690
is my problem, and mine only.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.490
Jolyne, how can you say that
when you fully know

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.530
how I feel towards you?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.330
You've already given me so much.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.410
I see a bright hope

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.250
I couldn't find anywhere,
inside or outside of the prison.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.000
And that's why I'm here with you.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.460
Hey, what's this?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.840
Why is it latching onto me?

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:27.880
I'm not sure.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.630
"I'm not sure" isn't an answer.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.590
It's chewing on my hair!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.850
It's eating dirt too.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:42.400
So, is it actually a plant?
Does it need nutrients?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.900
But it sleeps a lot too.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:48.780
Jolyne, get down.

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.200
Something is coming.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:00.670
There are two of them,
and they've already closed in on us.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:09.720
F.F.!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:13.970
Jolyne… I know who Pale Snake is.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.810
It's Father Pucchi, Jolyne.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.520
It was Father Pucchi all along.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:22.400
I almost died.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.610
If Weather Forecast hadn't come,
I wouldn't be alive right now.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.030
F.F.!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.400
I'm fine.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.200
I only threw out my body.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.030
What happened to you guys, Jolyne?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.870
Let me heal your right eye.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.330
What you said just now…

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:45.210
Yes. Father Pucchi
was trying to track down

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.840
the baby's location from D an' G's memory.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.420
Now, we only need to corner him.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.470
There's finally a way for us to win.
Weather Forecast came too.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.350
Weather Forecast.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.510
Jolyne…

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.390
Have you recovered from the injuries
you sustained at the factory?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.600
Yes. I hope you've been okay.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:12.200
What the hell is this?
What are those two doing?

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.610
They are embracing.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.450
I know that much! F.F., separate them!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.120
Separate them now!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.040
I have to do it?

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.950
Yes, you!

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.040
Remember our terms?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.330
That asshole's smell
is rubbing off on Jolyne!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.040
Calm down, it's just a greeting!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.300
See? They stopped.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.760
Stop being dramatic.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.590
We found out Pale Snake's identity.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.510
We don't have time for this petty fight.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:38.050
Hey, are you talking back to me?

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.760
What the hell are you thinking?

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.970
How dare you forget our promise.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.310
You are nothing but plankton.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.770
Jolyne, now that we know
who Pale Snake is,

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:51.150
we don't need this thing anymore.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.490
There's no use for it.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:54.860
Let's kill it.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.200
Give me permission, Jolyne.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:58.200
Wait a minute.

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:00.830
It's not your ally, Jolyne.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.080
It's not even human.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.580
It didn't exist in the first place.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:08.790
This being is lower than animals.
It should have never been born.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:12.300
We shouldn't keep unknown creatures
like this one alive.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.670
So please, let me.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.130
Now hold on.
You better watch it, Anastasia.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.100
Are you talking about me?
Careful how you phrase things.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.890
Don't touch me.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.810
We don't have time for that, plankton.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:28.060
Weather Forecast,
you know the situation, right?

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.400
Give me permission.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.230
No. I cannot do that.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.990
You are the one who will die.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.880
F.F., who the hell did you bring?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.470
Bastard…

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:59.590
Fuck, you got me.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.720
This can't be.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.680
This isn't… This can't be happening!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.430
He's not Weather Forecast.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:07.560
He's…

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.400
He's…

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:12.610
We were… being tricked.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.780
Thank you, F.F., for taking me here

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:23.120
before the real Weather Forecast
caught up.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.960
Five hundred forty-seven.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.840
Five hundred fifty-seven.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.710
No one can divide prime numbers.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.630
It took such a long time.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.340
I waited 22 years.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:43.600
The pinnacle of heights
humans are able to achieve…

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.470
This is undoubtedly it.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.690
We finally meet,
you who will help me get to heaven!

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.650
Though incomplete and inchoate,

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:57.820
the only thing left for me to do is to
trace the memory sealed by Jotaro Kujo.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.360
The new moon rises tonight.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.490
Dio.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.200
No other night is better suited

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.870
to awaken you once again
so that you benefit my cause.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.830
Thirty-six of the worst convicts' souls
were absorbed

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.170
and gave rise to this new life form.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.250
That's what this green creature is.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.630
That reminds me.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.760
Before I begin…

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:28.720
I must send you to an absolute death
where you are forever forgotten.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.020
Now stand, Jotaro's daughter.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.520
Though I struck a fatal blow,

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:36.520
you managed to block
a split second faster than the others.

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:42.610
If you won't attack, then I will!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.740
I didn't think

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:53.080
this was how I'd find out
who you were, Pale Snake.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.170
I didn't think
I'd see you again like this.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.800
I'm taking three things from you.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.760
My father's memory,

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.300
the disc you took from F.F.,

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.510
and your life!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.200
What is the meaning of these handcuffs?

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.050
You've never worn handcuffs before?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.180
I had to wear them almost every day
ever since your ploy brought me here.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.390
You think you caught me with these?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.520
Do you know what handcuffs are for?

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.600
They aren't to keep someone
from running away.

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:57.020
They are used to make others submit!

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:01.690
You still don't seem to understand
what you are doing right now.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:05.700
We are connected through these handcuffs.

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.910
Do you know what that means?

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.450
Let's see who is the one
that's being kept here.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:17.830
I already turned your Stone Ocean
into one of my discs.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.050
It's so close to falling out,
I can almost grab it.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.510
Do you see it now?

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:28.840
So who is the one in a predicament here,
you or me?

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:35.020
Well, I really don't get
what you are on about…

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.350
That's all I know.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:39.020
A few millimeters.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.020
A few millimeters, and this fight is over.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:46.780
If I can enter just a few millimeters
within my range of aerial attack,

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.360
my fist can land a blow.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:53.580
Some swallows die from flying
directly into cliff walls.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:59.040
It's because their parents
never taught them the safe diving range,

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:01.790
leading the swallows
to soar at a dangerous angle.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.840
It's not that the birds' parents
aren't teaching their offspring.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:09.010
The parents cannot teach it because
their own parents never taught them.

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:11.930
This family of birds tends to have
a short lifespan,

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.470
and they don't even realize why
they're prone to dying from accidents.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.940
Jotaro had a short lifespan.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.620
Stone Ocean is mine!

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.290
I used her own disc to block her sight…
How did she know where I was?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.050
Did she use the cuff's vibrations
to guess?

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.220
No, it's her strong will!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.220
Her strong will detected my attack!

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.350
When she first entered prison,

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.980
I thought she didn't even have
a Stand ability.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:05.190
She seemed like a helpless little girl
crying over some asshole who used her.

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:07.650
This is bad.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:11.110
Her Stone Ocean has an advantage
over my Pale Snake.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.990
At this rate, I'm done for…

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:17.370
But more importantly,
the birthed creature will be destroyed!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.000
What did you throw just now?

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:23.960
What did you do?

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.920
I'm asking you what you threw!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:33.470
A disc is a physical manifestation
of one's soul.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.220
It can be stored forever.

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:36.850
However,

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:42.770
what if the disc is inserted
into someone on the brink of death?

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:48.610
The disc would perish
along with that person's death.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:57.620
That's Jotaro's memory disc
you've risked your life for.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.240
You can have it back.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:03.620
It's stabbed into Anastasia's dying body.

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.920
What will you do now?
Will you go get the disc?

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.460
Or will you continue
your handcuff death match?

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:15.430
It's risky to let go of Jotaro's disc,

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:19.640
but I've already memorized
the contents of the notebook.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:22.600
All that is left is the execution.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:26.060
What will you choose, Jolyne Cujoh?

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.940
How can you still be contemplating?

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:34.150
Your father is rotting away
along with Anastasia as he wastes away!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:45.460
All that I'm after
is the birthed creature.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.920
I won! As I thought, she chose her father.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:55.090
Spiral staircase, rhinoceros beetle,

00:16:55.180 --> 00:17:01.560
city of desolation, fig tart,
rhinoceros beetle, Via Dolorosa,

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:05.270
rhinoceros beetle,
singularity point, Giotto,

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:10.230
angels, hydrangea, rhinoceros beetle,
singularity point,

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.360
secret emperor.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.660
You've shown your interest.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.670
Are you willing to approach me?

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.840
Will this be the beginning of everything?

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:38.720
Now, I can depart
into your world with you!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:40.970
Hallelujah, Dio!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:44.890
Anastasia!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:56.200
This can't be happening…

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:59.740
No… this can't…

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.280
This isn't true!

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.490
Somebody!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.580
Isn't there anyone around here?

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.960
Somebody! A guard! I'm right here!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.750
Please, I need a doctor!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.210
-Hey!
-Diver…

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.090
-Diver… Drive.
-Please, somebody!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.300
-Can you hear me?
-Please, call for help!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.600
-F.F…
-Please!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:25.310
-Help!
-Jolyne is mourning.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:30.560
This is your fault, F.F.

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.230
Shit…

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.690
I'm cold.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.690
Actually, I'm freezing.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:40.530
Looks like my heart's
already stopped beating.

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:46.790
I guess her father's memory disc
is inside my body.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.790
It will disappear, along with my life.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:55.590
I tried to eject it,
but I'm fighting to stay awake.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.800
Looks like you are crumbling away.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.140
Come claim my everything.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.720
You have to be the one to do it.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.520
I'll leave my intellect for your use.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:11.480
You can use up all the life
I have left in me too.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.980
You can have my body.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:19.240
So come inside my body
and remove the disc for Jolyne.

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.700
Only you can do it, plankton.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.330
Answer me, F.F.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.330
We made a deal!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.750
You are supposed to follow all my orders.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.170
You have to keep your word.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.340
You have to stay alive.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.300
You can mutate my body as you please.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:44.010
Stop wasting time!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:45.550
My… consciousness…

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:47.640
It's… going…

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.940
This can't be!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.110
Anastasia!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:59.110
No… Jolyne.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.070
It's going to be all right.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:02.820
It's not how it looks.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.530
You've done it.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.450
Anastasia…

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.700
got the disc back for you.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:13.080
F.F., is that you?

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.040
Are you the one speaking?

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.340
One thing I feared the most

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:23.090
was losing the ability to even think
to say goodbye to my friends.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.010
But…

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:30.270
in the final moment, I could do just that.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:32.180
Jolyne,

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:35.560
please tell this to Anastasia
once he wakes up.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.400
His body belongs to himself.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.820
I used his life and intellect
to fill his wounds.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:43.820
Hold on!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:47.570
Why are you talking like this, F.F.?

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.200
Goodbye, Jolyne.

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.040
I can't be here any longer.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:55.710
F.F. is disappearing.

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:57.130
What are you saying?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.710
Stop talking like that!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.960
Look at me, Jolyne.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.920
This is my soul.

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:05.760
This is my intellect.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:09.890
I lived a life.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:13.560
I'll do anything to get your disc back
from the priest.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:15.730
I'm talking about F.F.'s disc.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.440
That will bring you back!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.400
That must be a different F.F.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.570
I don't think it would be me.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.530
Because this is me.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.570
This is me, saying goodbye.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:34.200
I'm so glad I got to say
my farewells… Jolyne.

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.040
This is all right, Jolyne.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.210
Everything is all right.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.880
I'm glad you got your father's disc back.

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:49.640
F.F…

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:58.900
Respond, F.F.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:01.980
I've lost you, F.F.

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:03.610
Where are you?

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:05.940
F.F.?

00:22:06.780 --> 00:22:08.910
Answer me, F.F.

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:12.870
F.F.

00:23:41.370 --> 00:23:46.380
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
